OL,3,GNEWSAHospital to start charging for
OL,4,Aprescriptions
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospital outpatients in need of certain
OL,7,Fprescriptions will have to pay the same
OL,8,Ffee for medicine as they would at a
OL,9,Fcommunity pharmacy.
OL,11,FThe Pharmacy Department at Guernsey's
OL,12,FPrincess Elizabeth Hospital (PEH) was
OL,13,Fto start charging for eligible
OL,14,Fprescriptions from 1 October to "ensure
OL,15,Fa fair and consistent approach across
OL,16,Fall dispensing settings", bosses said.
OL,18,FCharges would be #5.40 per item, in
OL,19,Fline with requirements of the Health
OL,20,FService Law and approval from the
OL,21,FCommittee for Health & Social Care, the
OL,22,FStates of Guernsey said.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
