OL,3,GNEWSAHospital to start charging for
OL,4,Aprescriptions
OL,5,
OL,6,FFees would only apply to patients who
OL,7,Fwould normally be expected to pay for
OL,8,Ftheir prescriptions in the community
OL,9,Fand anyone already exempt would not be
OL,10,Fcharged, it added.
